  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Generated appsettings.schema.json now mirrors DataAnnotations validation as JSON Schema constraints ([Range] to minimum/maximum honoring exclusive bounds, [MaxLength]/[StringLength] to maxLength) and emits a description for each option from XML doc comments or [Description]/[DisplayName], so editors enforce bounds and show docs while you edit appsettings.json. Constraints are only emitted for validated bindings and never reject a value the runtime binder accepts, so loose configuration is never over-constrained. Diagnostics CFG001-CFG007 are unchanged.",
